SUMMARY:The Conjurer: An Intimate Magical Experience with Master Magician Curt Miller in League City
DESCRIPTION:The Conjurer: An Intimate Magical Experience with Master Magician Curt Miller returns for 3 live\, family-friendly shows at South Shore Harbour Resort. \nThe intimate magical experience features amazing close-up magic\, clean comedy\, audience interaction\, theatrical lighting\, music and video in a vintage magic theater atmosphere— making it a great date night or friends night out. \nThe interactive show includes an incredible trick you will perform yourself. \nAdmission\nTickets range from $50 to $90. Order tickets or learn more. \n \nThis Featured Calendar Listing was sponsored by the event organizer and boosted in our calendar with images and more details. \nLearn more about promoting your event\, organization\, business\, or offer across all of our channels
