SUMMARY:The H-Town Disco Show at Miller Outdoor Theatre
DESCRIPTION:Miller Outdoor Theatre and JamPAC Entertainment present The H-Town Disco Show\, a live concert featuring disco hits from the 1970s. \nGuests can boogie down to favorite hits from artists like The Bee Gees\, Donna Summer\, KC and the Sunshine Band\, and more. \nBacked by the H-Town Orchestra\, local vocalists will be belting out the best tunes of the era accompanied by a full local dance company. \nFinding Your Seat at Miller Outdoor Theatre \nAs always\, all seats at Miller are free\, but covered seating for popular evening shows usually requires a free assigned ticket reserved 24 hours in advance. \nLearn more about getting free seated tickets at Miller. \nAdmission\nFree. Learn more or reserve a free seated ticket. \n \nThis Featured Calendar Listing was sponsored by the event organizer and boosted in our calendar with images and more details.  \nLearn more about promoting your event\, organization\, business\, or offer across all of our channels.
URL:https://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/the-h-town-disco-show-at-miller-outdoor-theatre/
LOCATION:Miller Outdoor Theatre\, 6000 Hermann Park Dr\, Houston\, TX\, 77030\, United States
CATEGORIES:Arts Performances,Boosted Calendar Listing,Concerts & Live Music,Dance Performance,Dancing,Date Night,Featured,Free,History & Culture,Kids & Families,Live Theater,Music,Nightlife,Outdoors,Parks,Variety Shows
