SUMMARY:Spiritual Resolve for Fearless Living at Eternal Gandhi Museum Houston
DESCRIPTION:Self Enquiry Life Fellowship presents Spiritual Resolve for Fearless Living: Guided Meditation & Lecture by Himalayan Monk\, HH Swami Vidyadhishananda at Eternal Gandhi Museum Houston. \nHis Holiness Swami Vidyadhishananda\, a Himalayan monk and Sanskritist\, will lead a sacred Sunday morning centered on the theme of spiritual resilience and resolve amidst unstable times. \nThrough direct experience of guided meditation\, along with words of wisdom and spiritual advice\, guests will take home meaningful guidance about spiritual resolve and resilience amidst the challenges and the difficult times ahead. \nThe fellowship invites all to discover the steady ground of spiritual wisdom and contemplative practice\, timeless anchors that hold firm through any challenge. \nThe morning will open with sublime Sanskrit chanting by His Holiness\, followed by guided meditation\, words of wisdom\, a blessing line\, and more. \nA light Vegetarian lunch will be provided in the foyer during the blessing line. \nDoors at 9:30am. \nAdmission\nTickets are $15. Get tickets or learn more.This Featured Calendar Listing was sponsored by the event organizer and boosted in our calendar with images and more details. \nLearn more about promoting your event\, organization\, business\, or offer across all of our channels. 
URL:https://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/spiritual-resolve-for-fearless-living-at-eternal-gandhi-museum-houston/
LOCATION:Eternal Gandhi Museum Houston\, 12379 Riceville School Rd\, Houston\, 77031\, United States
CATEGORIES:Boosted Calendar Listing,Featured,History & Culture,Learning & Personal Development,Nonprofits,Spirituality & Faith,Talks & Panel Discussion
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://365thingsinhouston.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Spiritual-Resolve-for-Fearless-Living-at-Eternal-Gandhi-Museum-Houston.jpg
END:VEVENT
