SUMMARY:Eureka Heights 10th Birthday Party at Eureka Heights Brew Co.
DESCRIPTION:Eureka Heights Brew Co. celebrates a decade of craft brewing with a full week of events from Tuesday\, August 18 to Sunday\, August 23—with the main event 10th Birthday Party happening on on Saturday\, August 22\,2026. \n10th Birthday Party\nThe 10th Birthday Party features anniversary beers\, live entertainment\, food\, and brewery festivities. \nAdmission is free\, with optional VIP tickets offering early entry from 10am to noon\, unlimited draft beer during VIP hours\, a commemorative anniversary glass\, kolaches and coffee\, first access to anniversary beer and merchandise\, unlimited pinball\, and more. \nGet advance VIP tickets. \nBirthday Week Schedule\n\n\nHigh Five Society Member Appreciation Night | Tuesday\, August 18\nEureka Heights Trivia Night | Wednesday\, August 19\n10 Years of Laces Out Run Club | Thursday\, August 20\nEureka Heights Garage Sale | Friday\, August 21\n10th Birthday Party | Saturday\, August 22\nPost Party by Eureka Chill | Sunday\, August 23\n\n\nAdmission\nNo cover; VIP tickets with loads of extras for $65+. Learn more or get VIP tickets. \n \nThis Featured Calendar Listing was sponsored by the event organizer and boosted in our calendar with images and more details. \nLearn more about promoting your event\, organization\, business\, or offer across all of our channels. 
URL:https://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/eureka-heights-10th-birthday-party/
LOCATION:Eureka Heights Brew Co.\, 941 W 18th St\, Houston\, TX\, 77008\, United States
CATEGORIES:Beer & Breweries,Boosted Calendar Listing,Date Night,Dogs,Featured,Free,Games,Mixers,Nightlife,Parties,Pop-Ups
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://365thingsinhouston.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Eureka-Heights-10th-Birthday-Party-Weeklong-Celebration.jpg
