SUMMARY:DaCamera: Jason Hainsworth & New Jazz Underground in Concert at Miller Outdoor Theatre
DESCRIPTION:Miller Outdoor Theatre and DaCamera present Jason Hainsworth and New Jazz Underground in a night of live music under the stars in Hermann Park. \nThe jazz double bill features Jason Hainsworth—a celebrated Houston native bringing passionate new life to a unique\, historically-significant sound pioneered by Texas musicians—and New Jazz Underground—an electrifying New York-based trio pushing the boundaries of jazz. \nFinding Your Seat at Miller Outdoor Theatre \nAs always\, all seats at Miller are free\, but covered seating for popular evening shows usually requires a free assigned ticket reserved 24 hours in advance. \nLearn more about getting free seated tickets at Miller. \nAdmission\nFree. Learn more or reserve a free seated ticket. \n \nThis Featured Calendar Listing was sponsored by the event organizer and boosted in our calendar with images and more details.  \nLearn more about promoting your event\, organization\, business\, or offer across all of our channels.
URL:https://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/dacamera-jason-hainsworth-new-jazz-underground-in-concert-at-miller-outdoor-theatre/
