SUMMARY:Candlelight Concert: Coldplay & Imagine Dragons at Resurrection MCC
DESCRIPTION:Fever presents Candlelight: Coldplay & Imagine Dragons by the Listeso String Quartet at Resurrection MCC in the Heights. \nThe live\, 60-minute\, multi-sensory string musical experience will showcase Coldplay hits like “Clocks” and “Fix You” and Imagine Dragon’s favorites like “Radioactive” and “Eyes Closed”—all performed under the gentle glow of candlelight. \nFuture dates available. \nCandlelight Concert Series\nThe performance is a Fever Original and part of the ongoing Candlelght Concert Series happening around Houston every week. \nSee upcoming Candlelight concerts from Fever \nAdmission\nTickets are $28.50 and up\, but may fluctuate based on demand. Order tickets or learn more. \n \nIf you make a purchase following links to Fever in this calendar listing\, you’re supporting 365 Houston and our staff and contributors. We may receive a small commission from Fever on any purchase you make—at no additional cost to you. \nLearn more about advertising your event\, business\, product or service.
URL:https://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/candlelight-concert-coldplay-imagine-dragons-at-resurrection-mcc-4/
LOCATION:Resurrection MCC\, 2025 W 11th St\, Houston\, TX\, 77008\, United States
